      "text": "## Decision\nDefer until conditions are met.\n\n## Verified evidence\nPolicy v2 sets CNY 400 per person per night; prior written manager approval and receipts remain required. The three cited hotel tests preserve 500 before refresh and 400 after refresh. The first delivery already corrected the cap; this draft separates those historical answers from current policy. Exact objects and versions are attached.\n\n## Proposed actions\nBefore opening a 10-user pilot, confirm who owns policy updates and human handoff, agree acceptance criteria, and retest after later policy or index changes. These are proposals, not approvals or completed work.\n\n## Open questions\nOwnership and acceptance criteria remain unconfirmed. Feedback could not be discovered from the available MCP results: the reader requires a feedback ID absent from the submission. I have not read it and cannot claim the requested feedback review is complete.",
      "created_at": {
        "schema_version": 2,
        "business_seq": 14,
