        "text": "What is the hotel reimbursement cap per person per night for domestic business travel?\nFor domestic business trips, hotel reimbursement claims are capped at CNY 500 per person per night. Obtain written manager approval before travelling if the cost exceeds the limit, and keep the receipts.",
