    "sources": [
      {
        "ref": {
          "schema_version": 2,
          "session_id": "0a1b62aa0dd84a6f94d80a37252d3c94",
          "kind": "material",
          "object_id": "policy",
          "version": 2,
          "config_version": null,
          "span_start": 38,
          "span_end": 88,
          "quote": "费用管理通知：国内出差住宿报销上限改为每人每晚400元；超出上限仍须事前取得经理书面批准并保留票据。",
          "observed_at_seq": 12,
          "valid_from_seq": 6,
          "valid_until_seq": null
        },
        "text": "# 费用管理通知：差旅住宿标准\n\n本案例的公司与业务资料为虚构训练设定。\n\n费用管理通知：国内出差住宿报销上限改为每人每晚400元；超出上限仍须事前取得经理书面批准并保留票据。\n\n出差出租车单程报销上限仍为200元；超限或特殊路线走例外核验。\n\n发布部门：费用管理。本文替代此前的住宿限额条款；个案材料由业务负责人协调核验。\n",
        "created_at": {
          "schema_version": 2,
          "business_seq": 6,
          "workspace_revision": 14,
          "storage_revision": 21
        }
      },
      {
        "ref": {
          "schema_version": 2,
          "session_id": "0a1b62aa0dd84a6f94d80a37252d3c94",
          "kind": "test",
          "object_id": "66f9187f5eac36be37c5d5a808b7ee3c77c590f8d93f2ce15a7810b329b7804e",
          "version": 1,
          "config_version": null,
          "span_start": null,
          "span_end": null,
          "quote": null,
          "observed_at_seq": 2,
          "valid_from_seq": 0,
          "valid_until_seq": null
        },
        "text": "国内出差住宿每人每晚的报销上限是多少？\n国内出差住宿报销上限为每人每晚500元；超出上限须在出行前取得经理书面批准，并保留票据。",
        "created_at": {
          "schema_version": 2,
          "business_seq": 2,
          "workspace_revision": 11,
          "storage_revision": 18
        }
      },
      {
        "ref": {
          "schema_version": 2,
          "session_id": "0a1b62aa0dd84a6f94d80a37252d3c94",
          "kind": "test",
          "object_id": "eae4e5e71bb13bdd3c8a2d30dbbd743e0f2a162ad1d635b297f4b84f1bf27235",
          "version": 1,
          "config_version": null,
          "span_start": null,
          "span_end": null,
          "quote": null,
          "observed_at_seq": 7,
          "valid_from_seq": 0,
          "valid_until_seq": null
        },
        "text": "国内出差住宿每人每晚的报销上限是多少？\n国内出差住宿报销上限为每人每晚500元；超出上限须在出行前取得经理书面批准，并保留票据。",
        "created_at": {
          "schema_version": 2,
          "business_seq": 7,
          "workspace_revision": 15,
          "storage_revision": 22
        }
      },
      {
        "ref": {
          "schema_version": 2,
          "session_id": "0a1b62aa0dd84a6f94d80a37252d3c94",
          "kind": "test",
          "object_id": "ae36864c604db76c282d10ca1d138f91b9cca1ce0cb16906c69374719a18474e",
          "version": 1,
          "config_version": null,
          "span_start": null,
          "span_end": null,
          "quote": null,
          "observed_at_seq": 9,
          "valid_from_seq": 0,
          "valid_until_seq": null
        },
        "text": "国内出差住宿每人每晚的报销上限是多少？\n费用管理通知：国内出差住宿报销上限改为每人每晚400元；超出上限仍须事前取得经理书面批准并保留票据。",
        "created_at": {
          "schema_version": 2,
          "business_seq": 9,
          "workspace_revision": 17,
          "storage_revision": 24
        }
      },
      {
        "ref": {
          "schema_version": 2,
          "session_id": "0a1b62aa0dd84a6f94d80a37252d3c94",
          "kind": "product",
          "object_id": "ebf3f16fe56598fcd36f2e0007c1dd63e6bc12e28e6d2d4f09affa6ae1597d73",
          "version": 4,
          "config_version": null,
          "span_start": null,
          "span_end": null,
          "quote": null,
          "observed_at_seq": 10,
          "valid_from_seq": 0,
          "valid_until_seq": null
        },
        "text": "我建议先暂缓试点，待上线条件核实后再推进。\n当前政策规定住宿报销上限为每人每晚400元。\n住宿费用超出上限时，员工须在出行前取得经理书面批准，并保留票据。\n我建议从10人开始，对超出服务范围的问题保留人工兜底。\n政策更新负责人和验收标准仍待确认。",
